@HostAddress = http://localhost:5298
@InvoiceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ProductId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Criar nota fiscal - sucesso (status inicial Open, sem itens)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar todas as notas fiscais
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Accept: application/json

### Buscar nota fiscal por id (troque o id abaixo por um id real retornado no POST)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{InvoiceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar nota fiscal inexistente (espera 404)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{InvoiceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Adicionar item a uma nota fiscal - sucesso (espera 204, troque o id e o productId)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{InvoiceId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{ProductId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Adicionar item - nota fiscal inexistente (espera 404)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{ProductId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Adicionar item - quantidade inválida (espera 400, validação do DTO)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{InvoiceId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{ProductId}}",
  "quantity": 0
}

### Adicionar item - productId vazio (espera 400, validação do DTO)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{InvoiceId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "quantity": 1
}
